                                                        ONCE UPON A TIME, WHEN THE JUNK DEMO WAS ALMOST FINISHED - WHEN THE BEST DEMO ON THE ST-MARKET WAS 'LCD' BY TEX, WE VISITED IQ2-CREW (AMIGA-FREAKS). THEY SHOWED US A COUPLE OF DEMOS AND ONE OF THEM WAS THE TECHTECH-DEMO BY SODAN AND MAGICIAN 42. KRILLE AND PUTTE LAUGHED AT US AND SAID THAT IT WAS TOTALLY IMPOSSIBLE TO MAKE ON AN ST. WE STUDIED IT FOR HALF AN HOUR AND SAID: -OF COURSE IT'S POSSIBLE.   WHEN WE WERE BACK HOME (WHEN NO AMIGA-OWNER WAS LISTENING), WE CONCLUDED THAT THERE WAS SIMPLY TOO MUCH MOVEMENT FOR AN ST.        NOW, WE HAVE CONVERTED IT ANYWAY. THE AMIGA VERSION HAD SOME UGLY LINES WHIZZING AROUND, BUT WE HAVE 3 VOICE REAL DIGISOUND AND SOME UGLY SPRITES. BESIDES, WE HAVE SOME TERRIBLE RASTERS.......            WE AGREE THAT THERE ARE BETTER AMIGA-DEMOS NOW, AND PERHAPS WE WILL CONVERT SOME MORE IN THE FUTURE.......     LET'S WRAZZZZZZZ................